        "label": "应用列表与凭据查询",
        "reason": "支持列表不暴露密钥、按应用去重，以及选择后返回注册凭据。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/integrations/lark/existing-apps.ts",
          "startLine": 63,
          "endLine": 94
        },
        "quote": "  list(): ReusableLarkApp[] {\n    const unique = new Map<string, ReusableLarkApp>();\n    for (const entry of this.entries()) {\n      const appId = String(entry.larkAppId);\n      if (!unique.has(appId))\n        unique.set(appId, {\n          appId,\n          name:\n            typeof entry.name === \"string\" && entry.name\n"
      }
    ],
    "questions": [
      {
        "question": "botmux 配置文件的所有权和权限是否需要在读取前强制校验？",
        "why": "材料检查了文件类型和大小，但未检查文件权限、所有者或符号链接边界；该文件包含明文应用密钥。",
